{"How do I use a template?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>How do I use a template?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-plus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></div>", "Can I change a template?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Can I change a template?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-1\">Yes. Templates are starting points. Edit the wording, add or remove options, reorder content and tailor it to your audience before launch.</div></div>", "Which template should I start with?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-2\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Which template should I start with?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-2\">For a quick decision, choose a live poll. For open feedback, choose a word cloud. For confidence or sentiment, use a scale. For learning, use a quiz or presentation.</div></div>", "Is Nervant free for live polling?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-3\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Is Nervant free for live polling?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-3\">Yes. The free plan covers live polls, word clouds and quizzes with up to 15 participants per session and 7 days of history, and there is no credit card required. Participants never need an account to take part. Paid plans raise the participant cap and keep your history for longer.</div></div>", "How do participants join a Nervant session?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-4\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>How do participants join a Nervant session?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-4\">Participants can join from a phone, tablet or computer using the session code or link. They do not need a Nervant account just to take part.</div></div>", "Which question types can I use?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-5\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Which question types can I use?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-5\">Nervant supports live polls, word clouds, scales, image-supported polls, quizzes and presentations. Choose the format that best suits the decision, discussion or knowledge check you need.</div></div>", "When should I use a word cloud instead of a live poll?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-6\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>When should I use a word cloud instead of a live poll?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-6\">Use a word cloud to surface themes in your audience\u2019s own words. Use a live poll when you want people to choose from a defined set of options and see the result together.</div></div>", "Can I run a quiz with Nervant?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-7\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Can I run a quiz with Nervant?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-7\">Yes. Create or adapt a quiz, host it live and invite players with a join code. It works well for learning checks, onboarding, events and podcast-style quiz sessions.</div></div>", "Can I see results after a session?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-8\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Can I see results after a session?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-8\">Yes. Keep the session in Saved to revisit responses, spot themes and use the evidence in your next decision or follow-up.</div></div>", "Can people book time with me through Nervant?": "<div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><button aria-controls=\":r0:-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"w-full min-h-[58px] px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg\" type=\"button\"><span>Can people book time with me through Nervant?</span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-minus w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\" id=\":r0:-9\">Yes. Nervant Slotz gives you a booking page: publish the hours you are free and people pick a slot themselves, with the calendar invite and confirmation email sent automatically. Every plan includes a booking page; paid plans add separate event types, each with its own hours.</div></div>"}